karena NMAX Turbo memakai

14
00:00:15,793 --> 00:00:16,965
versi elektronik bernama

15
00:00:16,985 --> 00:00:19,132
YECVT, dan Avanza memakai

16
00:00:19,152 --> 00:00:20,314
D-CVT.

17
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:21,753
Puli depan diputar mesin,

18
00:00:21,773 --> 00:00:23,375
