39
00:00:50,426 --> 00:00:53,409
YECVT membuang roller itu.

40
00:00:53,429 --> 00:00:55,040
Penggantinya motor listrik.

41
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,309
Komputer membaca sensor di

42
00:00:56,329 --> 00:00:57,207
