47
00:01:01,589 --> 00:01:02,273
Y-Shift.

48
00:01:02,293 --> 00:01:03,374
Di mobil,

49
00:01:03,394 --> 00:01:05,449
D-CVT milik Daihatsu menambah

50
00:01:05,469 --> 00:01:06,341
